":0.18,"payout_ratio":0.098000005,"revenue":42784079872.0,"revenue_per_share":232.586,"revenue_growth":0.454,"ebitda":4525862400.0,"ebitda_margins":0.10578,"gross_margins":0.24806,"operating_margins":0.11005,"profit_margins":0.06594,"net_income":2821289984.0,"total_cash":7584379904.0,"total_cash_per_share":39.329,"total_debt":3315539968.0,"debt_to_equity":11.483,"enterprise_value":154300022784.0,"enterprise_to_ebitda":34.093,"enterprise_to_revenue":3.606,"earnings_growth":0.945,"shares_outstanding":192624977.0,"float_shares":76159990.0,"held_pct_insiders":0.60133,"held_pct_institutions":0.17095,"beta":-0.142,"fifty_two_week_high":909.9,"fifty_two_week_low":370.0,"fifty_day_average":775.644,"two_hundred_day_avg":755.83923,"target_high_price":1100.0,"target_low_price":820.0,"target_mean_price":953.5,"recommendation":"strong_buy","num_analyst_opinions":22,"all_time_high":909.9,"all_time_low":248.1,"long_business_summary":"Syrma SGS Technology Limited provides turnkey electronic manufacturing services in India, the United States, Germany, and internationally. The company offers product engineering services, that includes design and development, and verification and validation; phototype manufacturing and platform/ system integration; and original design and manufacturing services. Its product portfolio comprises printed circuit board assemblies; box build, electromechanical assembly, and full-systems integration services, that includes firmware, software loading, validation, testing, and commercial or custom packing, as well as offers products, such as  scanning antenna, transceiver, transponder, disk drives, memory modules, power supplies / adapters, fiber optic assemblies, magnetic induction coils and RFID products, and other electronic products, as well as line tester development services. In addition, the company provides custom magnetic services, including brushless DC motor module for fan consists of brushless DC motor, driver circuit, and control system; electro-mechanicals; critical communication solutions; RFID tags and inlays; and magnetic products comprising custom magnetic chokes, magnetic inductors, and magnetic transformers. It serves automotive, consumer, industrial, healthcare, railways, and IT industries. Syrma SGS Technology Limited was founded in 1978 and is based in Chennai, India."}}